Email us, join the discussion on Reddit,

530
00:29:21,447 --> 00:29:23,712
or respond below with your questions,

531
00:29:23,712 --> 00:29:26,404
experiences, or a different view.

532
00:29:26,404 --> 00:29:29,190
Let’s keep the conversation going.

533
00:29:29,190 --> 00:29:30,526
What you bring may help shape

534
00:29:30,526 --> 00:29:35,067
what we explore together next.
